  "figshare_url": "https://springernature.figshare.com/articles/dataset/UVMulti_A_Large-scale_Benchmark_Dataset_for_Underwater_Video-level_Multi-task_Learning/30105151",
  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "The UVMulti dataset consists of multiple video samples, each containing an original frame sequence (sequence), along with its corresponding enhanced ground-truth sequence (sequence_enh), depth maps (depth), dense depth maps (dense_depth), annotated original image frames (images), and the corresponding pixel-level segmentation masks (mask). The data structure of each sub-sequence in the dataset follows the directory organization of video96.zip.",
